.TH batten-init 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-init \- Write a starter batten.toml, refusing to overwrite an existing one
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten init\fR [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write a starter batten.toml, refusing to overwrite an existing one
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Preview what would be applied, writing nothing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
